1-5|Townsperson accidentally bumps or insults a player-character.
6-8|A town guild is hiring for an expedition: use Table 29, the missions table, to determine the expedition.
9-11|Can the player-characters recover goods stolen from a townsperson or his guild?
12-13|Townsperson tries to pick a fight with a player-character.
14-15|A townsperson gets drunken and rowdy.
16-17|A townsperson who was just mugged approaches the player-characters and begs for help.
18|Player-characters see urchins harass a townsperson.
19|Lost, a townsperson asks for help.
20|Townsperson thinks he recognizes a player-character. Roll [[1d20]]: on a result of 1-16, he is mistaken; on 17-20, he is correct.